---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Contact & Advertise" description="Contact All-in-One Helper. Advertise: $50/mo per banner slot, 94 tools, 100 pages of inventory.">
<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
<h1 class="text-3xl font-black">Contact & Advertise</h1>

<div class="mt-8 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6">
  <h2 class="font-black text-xl">📢 Advertise with us</h2>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Put your brand in front of people who use free tools every day. All banners are direct-sold - no ad network middleman, no tracking scripts.</p>
  <div class="mt-4 grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-sm">
    <div class="border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-xl p-4 bg-[#FCFCF9] dark:bg-slate-800">
      <div class="font-black">$50<span class="text-xs font-normal">/mo</span></div>
      <div class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">Per slot. Header, top, sidebar or footer.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-xl p-4 bg-[#FCFCF9] dark:bg-slate-800">
      <div class="font-black">2-4</div>
      <div class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">Slots per page across 100 pages.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-xl p-4 bg-[#FCFCF9] dark:bg-slate-800">
      <div class="font-black">94</div>
      <div class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">Tools = high-intent daily traffic.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <ul class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 space-y-1 list-disc list-inside">
    <li>Static image/text banner, labeled "Sponsored"</li>
    <li>No JS trackers on your creative (we can host it)</li>
    <li>Monthly flat rate, cancel anytime, paid via Buy Me a Coffee or invoice</li>
    <li>Bundle discount: all footer slots site-wide for $300/mo</li>
  </ul>
  <a href="mailto:contactae2000@gmail.com?subject=Ad%20inquiry%20-%20All-in-One%20Helper" class="mt-4 inline-flex bg-[#FFDD00] border-2 border-black px-6 py-3 rounded-full font-black text-sm hover:brightness-95 transition">📧 contactae2000@gmail.com</a>
</div>

<div class="mt-8 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6">
  <h2 class="font-black text-xl">General contact</h2>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Bugs, tool requests, broken vows: <a href="mailto:contactae2000@gmail.com" class="underline font-bold">contactae2000@gmail.com</a> or GitHub: <a href="https://github.com/mrfentmen/all-in-one-helper" class="underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">all-in-one-helper</a></p>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Support the site: <a href="https://www.buymeacoffee.com/contactae2b" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline font-bold">☕ Buy me a coffee - contactae2b</a></p>
</div>
</div>
</Layout>
